sequenceDiagram
    actor Citizen
    participant Browser
    participant Storage as Supabase Storage
    participant DB as Supabase DB
    participant Server as Next.js Server
    participant Blockchain as Sepolia Network

    Citizen->>Browser: Submit Report (Data + Photo)
    opt Has Photo
        Browser->>Storage: Upload Photo
        Storage-->>Browser: Return image_url
    end

    Browser->>DB: Insert Report (status: Pending)
    DB-->>Browser: Return report_id

    Browser->>Server: POST /api/reward-citizen (report_id)
    Server->>Server: Validate & Initialize Wallet
    Server->>Blockchain: sign & send ERC-20 Transfer
    Blockchain-->>Server: Transaction Hash (reward_tx)
    
    Server->>DB: UPDATE CitizenReports SET reward_tx = hash
    DB-->>Server: Confirm Update
    Server-->>Browser: Return 200 OK
    
    Browser-->>Citizen: Display 10 Eco-Tokens Reward Banner
